  "solution": "1. ÷ and -\n\n__**912 ÷ 456**__ × 28 + 390 - 2 = 444\n\n⇒ __**2 **____**× 28**__ + 390 - 2 = 444\n\n⇒ __**56**____** + 390**__ - 2 = 444\n\n⇒ __**446**____** -**____** 2**__ = 444\n\n⇒ 444 = 444\n\n2. ÷ and +\n\n912 - 456 × 28 ÷ 390 + 2 = 444\n\n⇒ 912 - 456 × __**28 **____**÷**____** 390**__ + 2 = 444\n\n⇒ 912 - __**456 × **__**__0.071__** + 2 = 444\n\n⇒ __**912**__ - 32.376 __**+**____** 2**__ = 444\n\n⇒ __**914 - 32.376**__ = 444\n\n⇒ 881.624 ≠ 444\n\n3. - and + \n\n912 + 456 × 28 - __**390 ÷ 2**__ = 444\n\n⇒ 912 + __**456 × 28**__ - 195 = 444\n\n⇒ __**912 +**____** **__**__12768__** - 195 = 444\n\n⇒ **__13680__**__** - 195**__ = 444\n\n⇒ 13485 ≠ 444\n\n4. ÷ and × \n\n912 - 456 ÷ 28 + 390 × 2 = 444\n\n⇒ 912 - __**456 ÷ 28**__ + __**390 × 2**__ = 444\n\n⇒ __**912**__ - 16.28 + **__780__** = 444\n\n⇒ __**1692 - 16.28**__ = 444 \n\n⇒ 1675.72 ≠ 444\n\nHence, ‘**÷ and -**’ is the correct answer.",
